<title>HONG KONG: CCT 1996 year net loss HK$121.6 mln.</title>
<headline>CCT 1996 year net loss HK$121.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   18.0 loss   vs  0.1 gain</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	   vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  84.66 loss  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    121.60 loss vs  0.49 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		     345.27	vs  310.59</p>
<p>    Company name		 CCT Telecom Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Telecommunications equipment maker CCT Telecom Holdings was formerly China Treasure Telecom Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss of HK$28.47 million on write-off of deferred development expenditure and technical knowhow, loss of HK$25.35 million on write-off of slow moving and obsolete stocks, loss of HK$5.41 million on write-off of other assets, loss of HK$14.53 million from resturcturing costs and loss of HK$10.9 million on disposal of long-term investments.</p>
<p>Share earnings for the prior year has been adjusted for the rights issue in December 1996.</p>
<p>Total dividend for the year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
